//   - inLow: Low price of each bar.
//   - inClose: Close price of each bar.
//
// Parameters:
//   - optInPenetration: Fraction of the 1st candle's body the 3rd close must
//     exceed above the 1st close; larger = deeper penetration required. Default
//     0.3; minimum 0; RealDefault selects the default.
//
